  "rows": [
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU001",
      "text": "我现在看到 AI 回答下面带着“官方来源”四个字，第一反应已经不是放心了。",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 5.1243,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.1257,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU002",
      "text": "是先点开看看。",
      "start": 5.25,
      "end": 6.0231,
      "timing_kind": "PUNCH",
      "pace_class": "FAST_CLEAR",
      "generation_speed": 1.08,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.7169,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU003",
      "text": "因为有一次，我只是想偷个懒，查一条特别简单的退款规则。\n问题也很具体：",
      "start": 6.74,
      "end": 12.1917,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU004",
      "text": "“订单退掉以后，平台收的那笔服务费，会不会一起退回来？”",
      "start": 12.1917,
      "end": 16.2766,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU005",
      "text": "它搜了一下。\n几秒钟以后，答案出来了：",
      "start": 16.2766,
      "end": 19.3343,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU006",
      "text": "“会。退款完成后，款项会原路退回。”",
      "start": 19.3343,
      "end": 21.6826,
      "timing_kind": "PUNCH",
      "pace_class": "FAST_CLEAR",
      "generation_speed": 1.08,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.3317,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU007",
      "text": "下面还真的挂着一条官方帮助中心的链接。",
      "start": 22.0143,
      "end": 24.5212,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.6931,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU008",
      "text": "我当时那个放心程度，大概相当于老师不仅告诉你答案，还把参考答案拍在了桌上。",
      "start": 25.2143,
      "end": 30.7116,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.4027,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU009",
      "text": "于是我顺手就在成本表里写了一行：\n“服务费：可退。”",
      "start": 31.1143,
      "end": 34.5399,
      "timing_kind": "PUNCH",
      "pace_class": "FAST_CLEAR",
      "generation_speed": 1.08,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.4344,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU010",
      "text": "本来这件事到这里已经结束了。\n但我那天可能刚好手比较欠。",
      "start": 34.9743,
      "end": 38.5833,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.771,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU011",
      "text": "我点开了那个官方网页。",
      "start": 39.3543,
      "end": 40.834,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.3703,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU012",
      "text": "网页没找错。\n标题就是退款规则。",
      "start": 41.2043,
      "end": 43.2725,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.2918,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU013",
      "text": "甚至 AI 刚才那句话，也真的能在上面找到。",
      "start": 43.5643,
      "end": 47.0194,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU014",
      "text": "上面写着：\n“退款完成后，订单款项将退回原支付方式。”",
      "start": 47.0194,
      "end": 50.8475,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU015",
      "text": "我往下又看了一行。",
      "start": 50.8475,
      "end": 52.0704,
      "timing_kind": "PUNCH_SETUP",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.4071,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU016",
      "text": "“平台服务费不予退还。”",
      "start": 52.4775,
      "end": 54.2775,
      "timing_kind": "REVERSAL",
      "pace_class": "CONTROLLED",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.34,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU018",
      "text": "我又看了一眼 AI 的答案。\n“会。”",
      "start": 56.0175,
      "end": 58.2582,
      "timing_kind": "PUNCH",
      "pace_class": "FAST_CLEAR",
      "generation_speed": 1.08,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.1193,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU019",
      "text": "再看网页。\n“不予退还。”",
      "start": 58.3775,
      "end": 59.9775,
      "timing_kind": "REVERSAL",
      "pace_class": "CONTROLLED",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.37,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU020",
      "text": "这时候最奇怪的地方就出现了。\n它不是没联网。\n也不是搜到了什么野鸡论坛。",
      "start": 60.3475,
      "end": 64.9302,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.8173,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU021",
      "text": "它甚至把正确的官网放在了我面前。",
      "start": 65.7475,
      "end": 67.712,
      "timing_kind": "PUNCH",
      "pace_class": "FAST_CLEAR",
      "generation_speed": 1.08,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 1.0455,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU022",
      "text": "但它拿着回答“订单款项去哪儿”的那句话，回答了我“服务费退不退”的问题。",
      "start": 68.7575,
      "end": 73.2732,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.7143,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU023",
      "text": "就像我问一个人：\n“老板今天来不来？”",
      "start": 73.9875,
      "end": 76.4488,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.0587,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU024",
      "text": "他翻开通讯录，准确找到了老板那一页，然后特别自信地告诉我：",
      "start": 76.5075,
      "end": 81.2423,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU025",
      "text": "“老板电话是 138……”\n资料没找错。\n答案还是没回答问题。",
      "start": 81.2423,
      "end": 84.2596,
      "timing_kind": "PUNCH",
      "pace_class": "FAST_CLEAR",
      "generation_speed": 1.08,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.9727,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU026",
      "text": "我后来又试了一次。\n这次没问它“答案是什么”。\n我只问：",
      "start": 85.2323,
      "end": 88.7957,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.1466,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU027",
      "text": "“你引用的网页里，哪一句话明确说明服务费会退？”",
      "start": 88.9423,
      "end": 92.174,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.3083,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU028",
      "text": "它重新看了一遍。",
      "start": 92.4823,
      "end": 93.9538,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU029",
      "text": "然后答案变了。",
      "start": 93.9538,
      "end": 94.7269,
      "timing_kind": "PUNCH",
      "pace_class": "FAST_CLEAR",
      "generation_speed": 1.08,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.7169,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU030",
      "text": "因为“搜到网页”和“用对网页里的证据”，其实是两件事。",
      "start": 95.4438,
      "end": 98.8039,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.3499,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU031",
      "text": "搜索做的，是把可能有用的资料拿回来。",
      "start": 99.1538,
      "end": 101.6706,
      "timing_kind": "PUNCH",
      "pace_class": "FAST_CLEAR",
      "generation_speed": 1.08,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.6632,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU032",
      "text": "但资料回来以后，模型还得判断：\n哪一句跟你的问题真正对应。\n哪些只是看起来很像。",
      "start": 102.3338,
      "end": 108.0344,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.1994,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU033",
      "text": "有没有例外。",
      "start": 108.2338,
      "end": 109.7053,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU034",
      "text": "几句话放在一起以后，结论到底是什么。",
      "start": 109.7053,
      "end": 112.4234,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.1419,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU035",
      "text": "这一步如果错了，就会出现一种特别有迷惑性的答案：\n来源是真的。\n链接也是真的。",
      "start": 112.5653,
      "end": 118.1375,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.1578,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU036",
      "text": "甚至引用的句子也是真的。",
      "start": 118.2953,
      "end": 119.9034,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.4119,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU037",
      "text": "只有最后那个结论，是错的。",
      "start": 120.3153,
      "end": 122.2376,
      "timing_kind": "PUNCH",
      "pace_class": "FAST_CLEAR",
      "generation_speed": 1.08,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.4177,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU038",
      "text": "所以现在我看 AI 搜索结果，已经不太把“有引用”当成正确证明了。",
      "start": 122.6553,
      "end": 127.266,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU039",
      "text": "如果答案不重要，我当然也不会每次都去查。",
      "start": 127.266,
      "end": 130.2409,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU040",
      "text": "但如果这件事真的会让我花钱、改方案，或者做一个很难撤回来的决定，",
      "start": 130.2409,
      "end": 135.3609,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU041",
      "text": "我会多问一句：",
      "start": 135.3609,
      "end": 136.4606,
      "timing_kind": "PUNCH_SETUP",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.2503,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU042",
      "text": "“这个来源里的哪句话，真的支持你的结论？”",
      "start": 136.7109,
      "end": 139.3465,
      "timing_kind": "PUNCH",
      "pace_class": "FAST_CLEAR",
      "generation_speed": 1.08,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.7144,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU043",
      "text": "因为 AI 搜索最容易让我放松警惕的地方，可能恰恰就是——",
      "start": 140.0609,
      "end": 144.0831,
      "timing_kind": "NORMAL",
      "pace_class": "NORMAL",
      "generation_speed": 1,
      "voice_profile_id": "VOICE_TIMING_PROFILE_COSYVOICE_300M_V2_1",
      "seed": 1986,
      "reference_audio_resource_id": "voice_reference:default_narrator_v1",
      "reference_text_resource_id": "voice_reference_text:default_narrator_v1",
      "authored_pause_after": 0.0478,
      "allowed_alignment_tolerance_ms": 120,
      "runtime_overrides": {}
    },
    {
      "speech_unit_id": "SU044",
      "text": "它真的给我找对了网页。",
      "start": 144.1309,
      "end": 146.0248,
      "timing_kind": "FINAL",
      "pace_class": "FINAL",
